WEBVTT

00:31.300 --> 00:33.300
[You Have My Heart]

00:33.360 --> 00:36.230
[Episode 4: Fates are already intertwined]

00:41.120 --> 00:41.830
My Lord,

00:42.240 --> 00:43.270
you're not really planning

00:43.270 --> 00:45.190
to use this flatbread as a clue, are you?

00:45.190 --> 00:46.720
Do you have any other leads?

00:46.880 --> 00:48.810
This is the only one we have for now.

00:51.240 --> 00:53.570
Village Chief Zhou fled from Shi Village.

00:53.600 --> 00:56.120
The wine merchant entered the county
from the north.

00:56.120 --> 00:57.760
Although the routes are different,

00:57.760 --> 01:00.880
they both passed through Nanqiutou Road.

01:01.520 --> 01:03.440
The child's home is also nearby.

01:03.800 --> 01:05.190
So just investigate along this road.

01:05.190 --> 01:07.400
See who sells this kind of flatbread.

01:07.400 --> 01:09.800
This... Which tavern, restaurant,
or shop doesn't have this?

01:09.800 --> 01:10.800
Even street vendors can sell them.

01:10.800 --> 01:12.220
And... And they all look the same.

01:12.220 --> 01:14.039
How am I supposed to investigate?

01:14.039 --> 01:15.240
The oiled paper is different.

01:15.240 --> 01:16.970
And the taste is different too.

01:18.120 --> 01:20.250
You... You're not telling me

01:20.800 --> 01:22.010
that I should take this flatbread

01:22.010 --> 01:24.010
and taste them door to door, are you?

01:31.039 --> 01:32.640
The bottom is heavily burnt.

01:32.960 --> 01:34.090
The crust is crispy.

01:34.430 --> 01:36.289
And the oil
has a hint of sesame fragrance.

01:36.289 --> 01:36.830
Sesame?

01:36.830 --> 01:38.759
When you swallow it, it's a bit dry.

01:39.120 --> 01:40.450
And it's slightly sour.

01:41.979 --> 01:43.039
Young Magistrate,

01:43.870 --> 01:44.870
how come I never noticed before

01:44.870 --> 01:47.200
that you have this kind of peculiar habit?

01:47.200 --> 01:48.640
I've already tested all these flatbreads

01:48.640 --> 01:50.700
left by them. They're not poisonous.

01:52.020 --> 01:53.750
Don't eat all of them. Leave a bite.

01:53.750 --> 01:54.550
Don't worry.

01:54.920 --> 01:56.190
Just looking at them makes me sick.

01:56.190 --> 01:59.390
I will definitely not eat
these dead people's leftovers.

01:59.640 --> 02:00.770
Now go investigate.

02:11.400 --> 02:11.870
Master,

02:12.400 --> 02:13.800
staying with Bai Shanjun

02:13.800 --> 02:15.990
can really increase your spiritual power.

02:15.990 --> 02:19.120
The water in this spiritual spring
has truly increased.

02:19.480 --> 02:21.480
It has indeed increased quite a bit.

02:21.710 --> 02:22.870
Bai Shanjun

02:22.890 --> 02:24.620
looks like a lazy one on the surface,

02:24.620 --> 02:26.550
but in truth he is upright at heart.

02:26.960 --> 02:31.079
It's just that his official career
has been rough, which dampened his spirit.

02:31.079 --> 02:34.400
If Bai Han
had even a third of his toughness,

02:35.430 --> 02:36.200
back then...

02:38.960 --> 02:39.870
But Master,

02:40.870 --> 02:42.829
if he really is just a mortal,

02:43.030 --> 02:46.400
letting him go down the mountain
to investigate might put him in danger.

02:46.400 --> 02:47.120
What if...

02:48.990 --> 02:51.120
What if something really happens to him,

02:51.120 --> 02:53.450
and we lose the source of spiritual power?

02:54.320 --> 02:57.320
Do you think I really need him
to investigate the case?

02:59.270 --> 03:00.200
I see.

03:00.590 --> 03:02.870
You want to use him to lure Bai Han out.

03:07.430 --> 03:09.630
But if you truly need him,

03:10.030 --> 03:12.240
why not just use some tricks

03:12.400 --> 03:14.430
to make him see the truth of this world?

03:14.430 --> 03:16.160
It would save all this trouble.

03:16.270 --> 03:18.200
Even I find it exhausting to watch.

03:19.990 --> 03:21.660
If we forcibly open the Heavenly Eye,

03:21.660 --> 03:23.720
he might get scared silly or run away.

03:23.920 --> 03:25.250
How could I use him then?

03:25.480 --> 03:27.400
This is fine just the way it is.

03:27.990 --> 03:29.720
Let him figure it out on his own.

03:29.800 --> 03:32.400
In the future, every bit of belief he has

03:32.960 --> 03:34.590
will be earned by himself.

03:35.310 --> 03:36.240
It will be solid.

03:39.550 --> 03:42.030
There are simply too many people
coming and going in this shop.

03:42.030 --> 03:42.990
Even the owner himself said

03:42.990 --> 03:45.710
he doesn't remember at all
who came to buy the flatbreads.

03:45.710 --> 03:47.390
My Lord, over here.

03:48.950 --> 03:49.840
But I've already tried

03:49.840 --> 03:52.300
every flatbread shop at Yin-Yang Crossing.

03:54.070 --> 03:54.930
This is the one.

03:55.960 --> 03:58.230
[Sun's Bakery]

03:57.840 --> 03:59.630
Whether it's the taste or the oiled paper,

03:59.630 --> 04:00.560
they both match.

04:04.950 --> 04:05.600
Let's go.

04:09.720 --> 04:10.190
Sir!

04:18.120 --> 04:19.649
Would you like a flatbread?

04:22.600 --> 04:23.810
Don't be afraid, sir.

04:24.240 --> 04:27.040
I've been by the oven for years.

04:27.870 --> 04:29.870
The smoke has blinded one of my eyes.

04:34.550 --> 04:35.280
Sir,

04:36.120 --> 04:37.320
I'd like a flatbread.

04:56.510 --> 04:57.570
The taste matches.

05:18.590 --> 05:21.780
The size and the cut edge both match.

05:22.850 --> 05:23.700
Sir.

05:23.830 --> 05:26.270
Where did you get this paper?

05:29.750 --> 05:33.040
The paper is provided by the paper shop.

05:33.870 --> 05:36.280
We cut it ourselves

05:36.750 --> 05:38.610
and use it to wrap the flatbreads.

05:40.550 --> 05:42.510
So this piece is from your shop?

05:46.520 --> 05:48.520
Yes, it is.

05:48.950 --> 05:50.920
I don't know who drew it.

05:51.510 --> 05:53.630
That day when I was wrapping flatbreads,

05:53.630 --> 05:56.480
I flipped through the paper

05:56.840 --> 05:59.840
and saw a few pieces
with messy drawings on them.

06:02.040 --> 06:03.600
It gave me quite a fright.

06:09.370 --> 06:12.960
After that, I stopped using them.

06:21.730 --> 06:22.860
Do you have any left?

06:25.070 --> 06:25.870
Yes.

06:36.550 --> 06:37.870
I originally thought

06:39.720 --> 06:41.120
I could make do with them.

06:41.600 --> 06:44.630
But then when I saw the talisman,

06:45.390 --> 06:46.720
I always felt

06:48.120 --> 06:49.920
uneasy in my heart.

06:53.040 --> 06:53.870
Thank you.

07:00.190 --> 07:02.510
All the people involved in the case
bought flatbreads.

07:02.510 --> 07:03.240
And then?

07:03.640 --> 07:04.930
What does that prove?

07:06.780 --> 07:09.440
It proves
that Sun's flatbreads are delicious.

07:09.840 --> 07:10.280
No.

07:14.510 --> 07:17.160
If you ask me,
this talisman isn't strange at all.

07:17.160 --> 07:18.510
The owner himself said

07:18.600 --> 07:20.240
that the oiled paper was bought in bulk.

07:20.240 --> 07:21.280
Even he doesn't know

07:21.280 --> 07:22.550
who drew the talisman.

07:23.480 --> 07:24.410
No matter how you

07:24.600 --> 07:27.430
look at these flatbreads, they don't
seem like something that can kill.

07:27.430 --> 07:29.630
I think we've taken the wrong path.

07:30.190 --> 07:31.770
We should start with the evil power first.

07:31.770 --> 07:32.970
I'm so smart.

07:45.040 --> 07:47.040
Young Magistrate, are you alright?

07:47.130 --> 07:48.810
You don't... look well.

07:50.540 --> 07:52.600
You go back to the county yamen first.

07:53.280 --> 07:54.280
What about you?

07:56.230 --> 07:58.030
I have some matters to attend to.

07:59.050 --> 08:01.520
You still have to handle the case
when you go back?

08:01.520 --> 08:02.920
It's nothing important.

08:04.010 --> 08:06.740
Then...
the money for the flatbreads I bought...

08:13.240 --> 08:17.200
He doesn't seem... like his usual self.

08:31.390 --> 08:34.200
It's been unusually restless
under the spring today.

08:34.200 --> 08:37.270
I'm afraid...
we can't suppress it for much longer.

08:39.270 --> 08:41.909
We will suppress it for as long as we can.

08:43.559 --> 08:45.120
Wind shall not pass this boundary.

08:45.120 --> 08:46.510
Fire shall not enter the heart spring.

08:46.510 --> 08:48.310
The living return to the living.

08:48.440 --> 08:49.970
The dead return to the dead.

08:59.760 --> 09:01.360
Something wants to come out.

09:02.670 --> 09:04.200
It didn't wake up on its own.

09:04.510 --> 09:06.790
Someone awakened it.

09:11.480 --> 09:13.640
My heart... is beating.

09:15.090 --> 09:15.990
Bai Shanjun.

09:18.550 --> 09:19.810
You stay in the valley.

09:20.050 --> 09:22.300
If he takes one step
out of Yin-Yang Crossing,

09:22.300 --> 09:24.300
I will never be able to call him back.

09:29.270 --> 09:30.120
Bai Shanjun!

09:41.810 --> 09:42.660
Fufeng,

09:44.360 --> 09:45.550
you're late.

09:51.430 --> 09:52.190
Bai Han?

09:55.840 --> 09:56.990
Without this half of the heart,

09:56.990 --> 09:58.080
you can't walk out of there,

09:58.080 --> 09:58.870
Liu Fufeng.

09:59.840 --> 10:01.420
Now that I have the tree heart

10:01.420 --> 10:02.640
and have gained immortality,

10:02.640 --> 10:05.370
why should I stay
at this tiny Yin-Yang Crossing?

10:06.090 --> 10:07.780
I saved your life in the past.

10:08.600 --> 10:10.390
With this half of the tree heart,

10:10.390 --> 10:11.910
let's call it even.

10:12.100 --> 10:13.430
You used the evil power?

10:13.510 --> 10:14.340
Of course.

10:14.390 --> 10:15.980
Otherwise,
with just this half of the heart,

10:15.980 --> 10:17.620
how could I have gotten out?

10:20.530 --> 10:22.530
How many years have you been trapped

10:22.680 --> 10:24.130
in the spiritual spring

10:24.320 --> 10:25.580
at Yin-Yang Crossing?

10:28.390 --> 10:29.390
What a pity.

10:29.900 --> 10:31.500
You can only stand there.

10:32.240 --> 10:34.270
If you dare take even one step out,

10:34.630 --> 10:36.360
both Yin-Yang Crossing and you

10:36.460 --> 10:38.060
will be reduced to ashes.

10:39.030 --> 10:39.990
Do you dare?

10:42.360 --> 10:44.220
And how long have you been trapped

10:44.750 --> 10:46.150
by this half of the heart?

10:51.370 --> 10:52.170
Why should...

10:53.740 --> 10:55.410
this heart be yours?

11:11.340 --> 11:13.000
If you dare take one more step,

11:13.310 --> 11:15.370
I will destroy this half of the heart.

11:16.870 --> 11:20.030
Then both you and he will die.

11:22.730 --> 11:25.330
Then you'll also be doomed
beyond redemption!

11:26.560 --> 11:27.670
Let's try it then.

11:40.720 --> 11:41.510
Bai Han.

11:42.600 --> 11:43.440
In this life,

11:43.440 --> 11:44.960
I swear I will kill you

11:46.240 --> 11:47.840
and take back the tree heart.

11:48.500 --> 11:49.810
This oath

11:50.910 --> 11:53.840
shall never die.

11:57.270 --> 11:58.380
You are crazy!

12:42.560 --> 12:43.440
Bai Shanjun,

12:44.530 --> 12:45.590
come here quickly.

12:45.960 --> 12:46.940
My Lady?

12:53.870 --> 12:54.870
Come back now.

12:56.730 --> 12:57.500
My Lady.

13:04.750 --> 13:05.390
Hurry!

13:15.480 --> 13:17.030
Why am I here?

13:23.120 --> 13:24.630
My Lady, you...

14:05.990 --> 14:07.120
How are you feeling?

14:08.510 --> 14:11.120
Last night,
you were possessed by something evil.

14:11.120 --> 14:14.150
You almost stepped
beyond the boundary of Yin-Yang Crossing

14:14.150 --> 14:15.750
and had your soul destroyed.

14:22.170 --> 14:24.530
You must have misunderstood, My Lady.

14:25.480 --> 14:27.500
Yesterday, while investigating the case,

14:27.500 --> 14:29.230
I must have overworked myself.

14:29.450 --> 14:30.980
I was in a trance for a moment

14:31.080 --> 14:32.680
and just took the wrong path.

14:33.270 --> 14:34.080
Is that so?

14:34.440 --> 14:36.640
Then why did the talisman in your sleeve

14:37.330 --> 14:39.060
flutter without any wind

14:39.600 --> 14:42.390
and guide you toward a dead end?

14:43.200 --> 14:45.260
And how do you explain the black blood

14:46.160 --> 14:47.400
you coughed up?

14:48.560 --> 14:49.600
That talisman

14:49.990 --> 14:51.600
is not a child's doodle.

14:52.030 --> 14:54.160
It's a medium for drawing misfortune.

14:55.760 --> 14:56.560
My Lady.

14:58.280 --> 15:00.490
Maybe something was wrong
with the flatbread.

15:00.490 --> 15:03.280
It contained some unknown drugs

15:03.310 --> 15:05.110
that caused me to lose my senses.

15:05.560 --> 15:08.030
As for... As for the black blood,

15:08.480 --> 15:11.150
perhaps it was an old injury of mine.

15:13.030 --> 15:13.990
Bai Shanjun,

15:14.480 --> 15:17.070
are you truly foolish or just pretending?

15:17.630 --> 15:18.150
What?

15:18.960 --> 15:21.030
When you were little, did your parents

15:21.030 --> 15:23.890
also frighten you
with tales of Yin-Yang Crossing,

15:24.080 --> 15:25.870
so that even after seeing all this,

15:25.870 --> 15:28.330
you still
stubbornly cling to your beliefs?

15:35.510 --> 15:36.440
This is great.

15:37.440 --> 15:38.300
There's a cure.

15:40.380 --> 15:41.390
The medicine is ready. Drink it.

15:41.390 --> 15:42.320
I won't drink it.

15:42.670 --> 15:43.270
Drink it.

15:43.270 --> 15:43.910
I won't drink it, Mother.

15:43.910 --> 15:45.560
Drinking it will dispel the evil spirit
possessing you.

15:45.560 --> 15:46.120
I won't drink it, Mother!

15:46.120 --> 15:46.790
Drink it!

15:46.990 --> 15:48.150
Drink! Drink!

15:48.510 --> 15:49.270
Drink it!

15:49.510 --> 15:52.150
Drinking it will dispel the evil spirit
possessing you!

15:52.150 --> 15:52.670
Drink it

15:52.670 --> 15:54.200
-and you'll recover!
-Don't force my mother!

15:54.200 --> 15:55.480
Drink! Drink!

15:55.670 --> 15:56.320
Drink it!

15:56.320 --> 15:57.080
Let go!

15:57.080 --> 15:57.480
Drink!

16:06.120 --> 16:07.960
Mother, wake up!

16:08.630 --> 16:10.600
Mother!

16:12.080 --> 16:13.340
She can still be saved.

16:14.480 --> 16:15.740
She can still be saved.

16:23.910 --> 16:25.170
She can still be saved.

16:33.080 --> 16:33.600
My Lady,

16:34.600 --> 16:35.860
I have my own judgment.

16:36.390 --> 16:37.520
But no matter what,

16:37.910 --> 16:39.620
you saved me, Lady Fufeng.

16:39.840 --> 16:40.880
Thank you.

16:48.190 --> 16:49.000
Sit down.

17:12.670 --> 17:13.599
Don't be afraid.

17:19.560 --> 17:21.190
It's most useful to me

17:22.190 --> 17:23.520
if it stays safely here.

17:38.630 --> 17:39.430
But

17:40.120 --> 17:41.470
since I saved your life,

17:42.190 --> 17:45.590
you should at least give me something
to show your gratitude.

17:47.650 --> 17:49.890
My Lady, what do you want?

17:53.800 --> 17:55.040
For saving your life,

17:55.910 --> 17:57.640
you must pledge yourself to me.

18:05.900 --> 18:08.020
I want you to stay here

18:09.600 --> 18:10.950
and work for me.

18:13.720 --> 18:14.520
My Lady.

18:15.840 --> 18:17.080
We agreed before

18:18.110 --> 18:19.840
that after this case is solved,

18:19.840 --> 18:21.100
you would let me leave.

18:29.430 --> 18:32.870
Back then, I didn't know
you have such exceptional abilities.

18:32.870 --> 18:34.320
I have managed Yin-Yang Crossing

18:34.320 --> 18:35.910
for over 1,000 years.

18:36.800 --> 18:39.000
Sometimes I grow very weary.

18:40.120 --> 18:41.800
If you could help me,

18:42.550 --> 18:45.760
I guess I'd feel much more comfortable.

18:52.230 --> 18:54.080
My Lady, this is...

18:58.570 --> 18:59.370
Put it on.

19:00.380 --> 19:01.250
It took

19:01.500 --> 19:03.300
a lot of effort to save your life.

19:03.870 --> 19:06.280
If you encounter something
like yesterday again,

19:06.280 --> 19:08.250
place this willow leaf over your chest

19:08.250 --> 19:09.850
and silently recite my name.

19:18.370 --> 19:19.080
My Lady,

19:19.370 --> 19:21.430
I will leave once this case is solved.

19:22.410 --> 19:24.670
I don't need your kindness, Lady Fufeng.

20:42.870 --> 20:43.930
It doesn't matter.

20:44.190 --> 20:45.470
Whether I come or not

20:46.600 --> 20:47.910
depends on my mood.
